{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused run found one expected regression: a completed scheduler sweep retires a halted child before a later emit failure. The old test expected the pre-slice child to remain. I’ve replaced that assertion with exact equality against the completed sweep state, and retained the check that only the first allowed write occurs.\n"}}
